          "text": "You will learn"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33660618974491-How-to-show-review-star-ratings-in-Customer-Hub#h_01JMFXKQXYW3Q7XFMYRNHKG8ET",
          "text": "Before you begin"
        },
        {
          "href": "https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/33660618974491-How-to-show-review-star-ratings-in-Customer-Hub#h_01JMFXKQXYBJGQWEE7MQ5TRF8G",
          "text": "Where reviews data appears in the Customer Hub"
        },
        {
